    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d328-a4">

                <pb facs="0508" n="466" sameAs="frus:frus1863p1/pg466"/>

                <head>[Forwarded by Andrew A. Harwood, Commandant.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United States Steamer State of
                                Georgia</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Off New Inlet, North
                                Carolina</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1862-09-28"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 28,
                            1862.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gentlemen</hi>: Proceed on board the steamer Sunbeam
                    and make an examination of her hull, engine, and general condition. You will
                    furnish me with a report in writing of the circumstances attending her running
                    the blockade.</p>
                <p>Very respectfully,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JAMES F. ARMSTRONG, <hi rendition="#italic">Commander,
                        commanding.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Lieutenant Commander H. N. T. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Arnold</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Commanding United States Steamer Mystic.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Acting Master <hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Folsom</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">United States Steamer State of Georgia.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Acting Third Assistant Engineer <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jacob D.
                            Rodgers</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">United States Steamer State of
                            Georgia.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
